# Mylar Bolt / Fastener Insulation Sleeve (Mylar 螺栓/紧固件套管)

**Document:** Engineering reference, P19, revision 2026-09  
**Product family:** PET Film Insulation  
**Manufacturer:** WELLELE (Well Electric)  
**Product page:** https://welleletubing.com/products/mylar-tube-mylar-tubing/

